    <p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">Thanks to those who replied to my previous meeting proposal — the feedback was clear that <strong style="font-weight: 600;">Mondays don't work</strong> for the planning committee. I've revised the proposal, and based on your feedback, I'm proposing we shift to <strong style="font-weight: 600;">1st and 3rd Wednesdays at 8:00 PM</strong>.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">With Field Day 2027 on the horizon, it's time to get our planning committee together on a regular cadence. These monthly Zoom calls will help us work through the action items coming out of our 2026 debrief — drafting a field day chairperson, site reservations, equipment inventory, logging setup, operator training, GOTA coverage, digital &amp; satellite stations, and more.</p>
