    <p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">We'll try to keep the meetings to <strong style="font-weight: 600;">60 minutes or less</strong>. We'll share agendas in advance and post notes afterward so anyone who misses a call can stay in the loop.</p>
